  "results": [
    {
      "id": "q_the_emergency_council_meeting_1",
      "question": "What are the wizards asking the council to do in the emergency meeting-and what's the catch?",
      "strict_verdict": "fail_incomplete",
      "semantic_verdict": "fail_incomplete",
      "must_hits": [
        "arcane lockdown",
        "wards"
      ],
      "semantic_must_hits": [
        "arcane lockdown",
        "wards"
      ],
      "context_must_hits": [
        "arcane lockdown",
        "wards"
      ],
      "context_support_ratio": 0.5,
      "failure_surface": "synthesis_gap",
      "stage_loss_tokens": {
        "wizards' college": "synthesis_gap",
        "arcane lockdown": "hit",
        "wards": "hit",
        "tradeoff": "evidence_gap"
      },
      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The wizards are urging the council to enact a **citywide arcane lockdown**, but the catch is it will **seal routes and isolate parts of the city**, risking civilian harm, economic fallout, and potentially not fully stopping the cult anyway.\n\nFrom the projection:\n\n- **Request (OBSERVED + CANON):** The city has a **\u201cProposed arcane lockdown\u201d** and **\u201cPlanned magical lockdown\u201d** tied to the emergency council decision (the city, defenses & operational_status). This implies the wizards want authorization to activate the city\u2019s magical wards at full scale.\n\n- **The Catch (OBSERVED + CANON):**\n  - **Isolation risk:** \u201cAt risk of having parts isolated if key tunnels or access points are sealed\u201d (the city, operational_status).\n  - **Hidden routes problem:** The cult is **\u201cusing hidden routes\u201d** and **\u201chidden city infrastructure\u201d**, so a lockdown may not fully contain them (the cult, current_location & operational_status).\n  - **Economic pressure:** The city **depends on the festival** and trade; a lockdown threatens that (the city, economy).\n  - **Targeting/side effects:** Magical defenses and traps may affect those without proper protections (Players, defenses), implying civilians could be impacted.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Defenses: Proposed arcane lockdown; magical wards; sealing tunnels\n- Geography: Hidden passages and sewers; risk of isolated districts\n- Economy: Festival-dependent; trade hub vulnerable to shutdown\n- Threat: Cult using hidden infrastructure, may bypass lockdown",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_longmont_session_12_council_chamber_roster",
      "question": "Who's actually in the council chamber for the Session 12 fight with the Wolf?",
      "strict_verdict": "fail_incomplete",
      "semantic_verdict": "fail_incomplete",
      "must_hits": [
        "thalia",
        "wolf",
        "guards"
      ],
      "semantic_must_hits": [
