      "answer": "TL;DR: The Council Room was heavily disrupted\u2014hit by a Fireball, triggering its magical defenses, and left disheveled with active illusions and wards affecting the space.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Atmosphere (OBSERVED): \u201calmost the entire room is lit up by Fireball,\u201d indicating a major destructive spell impacting the chamber during Session 12.\n- Defenses (OBSERVED): Runes along the walls activated when Caelynn cast her spell; Illusory Walls and ancient defensive wards became active, changing how the room functions during the encounter.\n- Physical Condition (OBSERVED): The room is explicitly noted as \u201cDisheveled,\u201d reflecting damage and disorder from the conflict.\n\nIn short, the room wasn\u2019t structurally redefined, but it was blasted, magically \u201cturned on,\u201d and left in a chaotic, battle-altered state.",
